ken on August 04, 2026</in-capmkt:ReasonsForDateOfAGMOrEGMOrPostalBallotOrOtherIsNotFixed><in-capmkt:WhetherRecordOrBookClosureDateFixedByTheCompany contextRef="MainD">false</in-capmkt:WhetherRecordOrBookClosureDateFixedByTheCompany><in-capmkt:ReasonsForRecordOrBookClosureDateIsNotFixedByTheCompany contextRef="MainI">There is no requirement to fix record date/Book closure date as no shareholders meeting is being convened in this regard.</in-capmkt:ReasonsForRecordOrBookClosureDateIsNotFixedByTheCompany><in-capmkt:WhetherTheBoardDecidedTheModeThroughWhichFundShallBeRaised contextRef="MainD">true</in-capmkt:WhetherTheBoardDecidedTheModeThroughWhichFundShallBeRaised><in-capmkt:TypeOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesProposedToBeIssued contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">Debt Securities</in-capmkt:TypeOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesProposedToBeIssued><in-capmkt:TotalNumberOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesProposedToBeIssued contextRef="D_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities" unitRef="shares" decimals="INF">25000</in-capmkt:TotalNumberOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesProposedToBeIssued><in-capmkt:SizeOfTheDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesIssue contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">250000000</in-capmkt:SizeOfTheDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesIssue><in-capmkt:WhetherProposedToBeListed contextRef="D_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">true</in-capmkt:WhetherProposedToBeListed><in-capmkt:NameOfTheExchangeWhereDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesProposedToBeListed contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">National Stock Exchange of India Limited</in-capmkt:NameOfTheExchangeWhereDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecuritiesProposedToBeListed><in-capmkt:TenureOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">24</in-capmkt:TenureOfDebtSecuritiesOrO